THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This license covers DanfoAI's own source code only. DanfoAI integrates with
third-party projects and models that carry their own terms:

  * YarnGPT (https://github.com/saheedniyi02/yarngpt) — Nigerian text-to-speech.
    NOT redistributed in this repository. It is fetched at setup time by
    ./yarngpt-service/fetch-yarngpt.sh and is gitignored. At the time of
    writing it publishes no license; review its repository before any
    redistribution or commercial use.

  * OpenAI Whisper / faster-whisper, WavTokenizer, and any Hugging Face models
    downloaded at runtime — each under its own license.

  * Soroban SDK, Stellar SDK, 0G SDKs, Next.js and other dependencies — under
    the licenses declared in their respective packages.

Contributors are responsible for ensuring any code or assets they add are
compatible with the MIT license above.
